<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS4" title="In 6 Analysis ‣ Training Language Model to Critique for Better Refinement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.4 </span>Why RCO Generate Effective Critiques for Refinement</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
