<td id="A2.T10.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T10.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T10.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T10.2.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Code Generation - HumanEval</span></span>
<span id="A2.T10.2.11.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Complete the code following the instruction given in the comment, as well as the format and the indentation.</span>
<span id="A2.T10.2.11.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">{prompt}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T10.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T10.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
