<span id="A2.T10.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T10.2.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Code Generation - DS-1000</span></span>
<span id="A2.T10.2.12.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Write a short code to solve the problem following the given format and indentation. Place the executable code between &lt;code&gt; and &lt;/code&gt; tags, without any other non-executable things.</span>
<span id="A2.T10.2.12.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">{prompt}</span>
</span></td></tr>
