<span id="A2.T16.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T16.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Auto-J-13B Prompt</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T16.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T16.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T16.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T16.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">[INST] Write critiques for a submitted response on a given user’s query, and grade the response:</span>
<span id="A2.T16.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">[BEGIN DATA]</span>
<span id="A2.T16.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">***</span>
