<span id="A2.T16.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Write critiques for this response. After that, you should give a final rating for the response on a scale of 1 to 10 by strictly following this format: "[[rating]]", for example: "Rating: [[5]]". [/INST]</span>
</span></td></tr>
