<span id="A2.T17.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T17.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T17.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">UltraCM-13B Prompt</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T17.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T17.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T17.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T17.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Given my answer to an instruction, your role is to provide specific and constructive feedback for me. You should find the best way for me to learn from your feedback and improve my performance.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T17.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T17.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T17.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T17.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You should consider multiple aspects of my answer, including helpfulness, truthfulness, honesty, and to what extent the answer follows instructions.</span>
<span id="A2.T17.2.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">—</span>
</span></td></tr>
