<span id="A2.T33.2.8.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">{critique<span id="A2.T33.2.8.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline"> </span>1}</span>
<span id="A2.T33.2.8.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">[The End of Assistant B’s Critique]</span>
