<span id="A2.T36.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">"Please act as an impartial judge and evaluate the quality of the critiques provided by two AI assistants for my answer to the math problem displayed below. Your evaluation should focus on the quality, clarity, and constructiveness of the critiques, particularly the "Suggestions for improvement" field.</span>
